# Save this file as ".htaccess" in the AFS directory you want to protect.
# Restricts access to members of a Stanford workgroup (privgroup), plus the owner.
#
# Replace the workgroup with your own (created at https://workgroup.stanford.edu).
# Workgroup names are "stem:id" — e.g. its:directors, gsb:affiliates, ~jdoe:website-editors
#
# Pair with these AFS ACLs on the same directory:
#   fs sa . system:www-servers read
#   fs sa . system:anyuser none
#
# If authorized members are denied, check the workgroup's VISIBILITY settings:
#   https://uit.stanford.edu/service/workgroup/visibility
#
# NOTE: keep a trailing newline after the last directive or it may be ignored.

AuthType WebAuth
require privgroup ~jdoe:website-editors
require user jdoe
